gle-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPIC QUESTS. INSTANT ADVENTURES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the magic of Dungeons &amp; Dragons like never before in this tactical, cooperative digital board game set in Forgotten Realms. Command your heroes, unravel sinister plots and forge mighty alliances in turn-based combat and choice-based storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Iconic D&amp;D Elements with Streamlined Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From recognizable settings and classic D&amp;D classes \u2013 like paladin, sorcerer, ranger, fighter, bard, and rogue \u2013 to fiery explosions and divine healing, Battlemarked delivers quick, pick-up-and-play action for players of every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.poster.avif?t=1771866484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.webm?t=1771866484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.mp4?t=1771866484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical, Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use unique card abilities and adapt your approach in turn-based battles that reward strategic planning \u2013 combine abilities, control the battlefield, and adjust your tactics with every draw to overcome ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.poster.avif?t=1771866484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.webm?t=1771866484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.mp4?t=1771866484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collaborate to Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can tackle adventures together \u2013 coordinating moves, setting traps, and combining abilities for maximum impact. Teamwork isn\u2019t optional \u2013 it\u2019s your most powerful weapon. Prefer to go alone? You can also command your party of multiple heroes in single player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.poster.avif?t=1771866484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.webm?t=1771866484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.mp4?t=1771866484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable Adventures, Multiple Campaigns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Neverwinter Wood, Cragmaw Castle, Spine of the World and more in two campaigns at launch, with additional DLC adventures on the horizon. Every run changes, keeping each session fresh.</p>","developers":["Resolution Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/b95edc419745dbe847ce6f717a8bc6b9d0f43cca/header.jpg?t=1771866484","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"DUNGEONS & DRAGONS is a trademark of Wizards of the Coast LLC and is used with permission. \u00a92025 Wizards of the Coast. \u00a92025 Resolution Games AB. All Rights Reserved. Demeo is a trademark of Resolution Games AB.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":80,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/demeo-x-dungeons-dragons-battlemarked?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124340/511831143/9e245e3f46cbda349d1d635ffc8586780b3ad3f9/1764012381/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764012996","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124340/511831143/9e245e3f46cbda349d1d635ffc8586780b3ad3f9/1764012381/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764012996","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124340/511831143/9e245e3f46cbda349d1d635ffc8586780b3ad3f9/1764012381/hls_264_mas